sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI
  participant API
  participant DB
  participant Queue
  participant Worker
  participant S3
  User->>UI: Просмотрел и подтвердил clip layout
  UI->>API: setLayout(key, versions, config)
  API->>DB: owner locks, replay lookup
  alt Exact replay
    DB-->>API: same accepted operation
  else New valid request
    API->>DB: quota + intent + lease commit
    API->>Queue: attempt identity
    Queue->>Worker: existing render
    Worker->>S3: create-only versioned objects
    Worker->>DB: fenced keys + published layout
  end
  API-->>UI: status / polling published version
